ImGuiItemFlags.NoFocus                = bitLShift(1, 17) -- false -- [EXPERIMENTAL: Not very well specced] Clicking doesn't take focus. Automatically sets ImGuiButtonFlags.NoFocus + ImGuiButtonFlags.NoNavFocus in ButtonBehavior().

