--- UNIMPLEMENTED / UNUSED:
---     stbtt_MakeCodepointBitmap
---     stbtt_MakeCodepointBitmapSubpixelPrefilter
---     stbtt_GetGlyphBitmap
---     stbtt_MakeGlyphBitmap
